  CardStory: "Spades2 grimaces. Of course not. She wasn\u2019t here yesterday. She\u2019s
    never been here. Yes she has.\r\n\r\nBut then there seems to be very little in
    her eyes at all. I think it\u2019s fine. Granted, Spades4 may not know much about
    himself, but she knows much about the order.\r\n\r\nSpades2 supposes that\u2019s
    what matters. So do I.\r\n\r\nAnd her smile is always ear to ear. Spades2 doesn\u2019t
    like it, for some reason. He\u2019s not sure why. But he\u2019s heard it say
    before. A smile from ear to ear. So have I."
